			"notes": "# IQExtra 1.0.1\n\nDEobf by Kwrg. Developed by PGSMZzz (iq-supporter-deobf + iqextra).\n\nIncludes complete iq-supporter functions and is compatible with the original iq config.\n\nPlease mark it as a repost if you send it to someone else. Future updates are not guaranteed.\n(or all your family members will die painfully ngl trust me i will actually go do that)\n\nThis release is completely unrelated to Kwrg-IRC itself; it’s just a side project we wanted to publish publicly.\n(Maybe this is the reason we decided to abandon development of certain Kuudra-related features, but idk)\n\nHaving Kwrg-IRC + iq-SUPPORTER-deobf + IQExtra installed will definetly give you a brand new experience while *enjoying* your life in Skyblock.\n\n## 📦 Requirements & Installation\n\n- **Minecraft**: `26.1.2`\n- **Java**: `Java 25`\n- **Fabric Loader**: `>= 0.19.3`\n- **Dependency**: `IQ 1.0.7` (Mixin verified against the SUPPORTER deobf-clean JAR; Fabric will report a missing dependency without IQ)\n- **Installation**: Place `IQExtra-1.0.1+mc26.1.2.jar` into the `mods` folder (delete any old `IQExtra` or `IQ Rend Guard` first).\n- **Config**: Internal ID `iq_rend_guard`, config file `config/iq-rend-guard.properties`.\n- **Note**: The files in RELEASE are not the mod itself. They are the deobfuscated version by kwrg, with iq-supporter-deobf and iqextra developed on top of it by pgsmzzz.\n\n==================================================\n\n# IQExtra 1.0.1\n\n反混淆：Kwrg。开发者：PGSMZzz（iq-supporter-deobf + iqextra）。\n\n包含完整的 iq-supporter 功能，兼容原版 iq 配置。\n\n如果你要把它发给别人，请标记为转载。后续更新不保证。\n（否则你全家都会死得很痛苦，信我，我真的会去干的。）\n\n本发布与 Kwrg-IRC 本身完全无关，只是我们想公开的一个副项目。\n（也许这就是我们决定放弃某些 Kuudra 相关功能开发的原因，但我不知道。）\n\n同时安装 Kwrg-IRC + iq-SUPPORTER-deobf + IQExtra，你在 Skyblock 里“享受”生活时绝对会获得全新的体验。\n\n## 📦 环境要求与安装\n\n- **Minecraft**：`26.1.2`\n- **Java**：`Java 25`\n- **Fabric Loader**：`>= 0.19.3`\n- **前置依赖**：`IQ 1.0.7`（Mixin 已针对 SUPPORTER deobf-clean JAR 验证；缺少 IQ 时 Fabric 将提示缺少依赖）\n- **安装方法**：将 `IQExtra-1.0.1+mc26.1.2.jar` 放入 `mods` 文件夹（如存在旧版 `IQExtra` 或 `IQ Rend Guard` 请先删除）。\n- **配置路径**：使用内部 ID `iq_rend_guard` 与配置文件 `config/iq-rend-guard.properties`。\n- **另外**：RELEASE 里的并非模组本体，而是由 kwrg 反混淆的，由 pgsmzzz 基于此开发的 iq-supporter-deobf 和 iqextra。"
		}
